# k.objects/shards/land: island, hole, hill, valley, cave, cliff, pit, grave. Parts with a primitive shape, a box in the 0 to 100 frame
# of the object (x right, y down), a draw order z and typical colours; points for lines and polygons.
# sources: hand-core 1 (hand-written in this repository)
# license: CC0-1.0
# script: none (hand-written)

# island
@k.objects.island k.objects.object name=island core.source="hand-core 1"
